   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Nationella Expertprogrammet v&#xe4;nder sig till experter p&#xe5;               utvecklingssamarbete anst&#xe4;llda inom Sida och UD. NE kan vara          anst&#xe4;llda i Bryssel eller p&#xe5; EU-delegation i max 4 &#xe5;r. Huvudsyftet &#xe4;r kunskapsutbyte och att f&#xe5; in fler svenskar i EU.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The National Expert Program is directed to experts in development     cooperation issues employed by Sida or MFA. They work as NE for a     maximum of 4 years in Brussels or in an EU Delegation. The main goal  with the program is exchange of knowledge and to have more Swedes     working within EU.</narrative>
